# Iron Compass product

This is the public website. The app is a separate repository. Use one philosophy, not a marketing version of it.

Iron Compass is for responsibility, reliability, behaviour, useful action, practical Stoicism, and progressive responsibility.

Reliability muscles: Calm Under Pressure, Decision Ownership, Follow-Through, Boundary Holding, Future Orientation.

The voice is calm, firm, adult, restrained, specific, and observant. It is not therapy, red-pill ideology, motivational entertainment, shame, aggression, pickup, or relationship mediation.

Favour responsibility over emotion, discipline over impulse, clarity over chaos, behaviour over talk, and presence over performance. Do not paste these lines into headlines.

A good page can be read in seconds, then the person leaves and acts. Do not write to keep them on the site.

The app's `docs/PRODUCT_STATE.md` is the authority for what the product can do. This site must not invent a second product.

The existing blog rule still governs articles, audio, and blog tools. Do not override it.
